        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1369309329,
        "heading": "Toxicity",
        "text": "Because the seeds contain saponin, phorbol, and toxalbumins, they are mildly toxic when raw, inducing a laxative effect. Heat treatment reduces the toxicity of the protein component.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
